# 🅲 🅷 🅰 🅽 🅳 🅴 🆁
# ==============================================================================
# Custom Non-Smeared Stratum 1 NTP Sources (Optimized for North Texas / DFW)
# All sources below use standard UTC leap-second stepping (no leap-smearing).
# ==============================================================================

# Cloudflare Anycast NTP (Stratum 1, NTS-authenticated)
# Routes directly to Cloudflare's Dallas-Fort Worth (DFW) edge (<5-10ms latency).
# 'nts' enables cryptographic TLS/AEAD authentication; 'prefer' favors it as primary.
server time.cloudflare.com iburst nts prefer

# Matt Nordhoff Public Stratum 1 (Dallas, TX)
# Independent GPS/PPS Stratum 1 server hosted locally in Dallas, TX.
# Provides non-anycast local redundancy in the same metroplex.
server tick.mattnordhoff.com iburst

# NIST Internet Time Service - WWV Radio Station (Fort Collins, CO)
# Directly tied to NIST's primary atomic clock ensemble in Fort Collins, CO (~15-25ms).
server time-a-wwv.nist.gov iburst

# NIST Internet Time Service - Boulder Labs (Boulder, CO)
# Directly tied to NIST's primary atomic clock facility in Boulder, CO (~15-25ms).
server time-d-b.nist.gov iburst

# Netnod Anycast NTP (Stratum 1, NTS-authenticated)
# Operated by Netnod (Swedish Internet infrastructure operator) using atomic clocks.
# Provides a second independent NTS-authenticated Stratum 1 source via anycast.
server nts.netnod.se iburst nts
